  "thag1.73:0.3": "",
  "thag1.73:0.4": "1. 8. 3. ātumattheragāthā. ",
  "thag1.73:1.1": "jiṇṇaṃ ca disvā dukhitaṃ ca byādhitaṃ ",
  "thag1.73:1.2": "mataṃ ca disvā gatamāyusaṅkhayaṃ ",
  "thag1.73:1.3": "tato ahaṃ nikkhamitūna pabbajiṃ ",
  "thag1.73:1.4": "pahāya kāmāni manoramānī’ti. itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ",
  "thag1.73:1.5": "māṇavo thero gāthaṃ abhāsitthā’ti. "
}
